data loss or manual reconfiguration.\n- The store's S3 endpoint is usable by platform components on the same\n  cluster without manual endpoint entry.\n- The build pipeline for any repository touched by this epic is green.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-2 (P0): Administrators can enable a supported, bundled S3-compatible\n  object store through the Platform Operator, with productized images and\n  upgrade lifecycle.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":38279,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6579f8638f8b64e","agent_id":"ab3d3c833fed09e80","session_id":"fb56929f-df9e-42c6-b5d2-389b8632f829","uuid":"5fe2c36e-ec23-4af4-abe3-7290ead09a56","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:20:30.506Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9012"}
