{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ba29107dd3b954f5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9012\n3\tepic_count: 5\n4\tcritical_path_length: 3\n5\tdecompose_complete: true\n6\trevised: false\n7\ttriage: null\n8\ttriage_rationale: null\n9\t---\n10\t# Decomposition Summary — RHAISTRAT-9012 (Bundle an S3-compatible object store for disconnected installs)\n11\t\n12\t## Triage\n13\t\n14\tFull decomposition (not below-threshold, not docs-only). The strategy spans multiple\n15\tcomponents and teams (legal, Platform Operator, Data Science Pipelines, model serving,\n16\tdocumentation) and contains a genuine gating unknown (AGPL-3.0 redistribution clearance)\n17\twhose bounded outcome changes what the productization work targets.\n18\t\n19\t## Epic List (main plan)\n20\t\n21\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n22\t|----|-------|------|------|----------|\n23\t| RHAISTRAT-9012-E001 | Legal review: redistributing MinIO (AGPL-3.0) in the product distribution | Investigation | Legal | P0 |\n24\t| RHAISTRAT-9012-E002 | Platform Operator enablement of the bundled S3-compatible object store | Implementation | RHOAI Platform Operator | P0 |\n25\t| RHAISTRAT-9012-E003 | Data Science Pipelines connection defaults for the bundled store | Implementation | RHOAI Pipelines | P1 |\n26\t| RHAISTRAT-9012-E004 | Model serving connection defaults for the bundled store | Implementation | RHOAI Model Serving | P1 |\n27\t| RHAISTRAT-9012-E005 | Documentation: enablement, sizing, and support boundary for the bundled store | Implementation (docs-authoring) | RHOAI Docs | P1 |\n28\t\n29\t### Branch epics (conditional, gated by E001 outcome)\n30\t\n31\tThe legal review has two bounded outcomes. The upstream image-productization chain\n32\t(midstream fork, license scan, Konflux pipeline, productized image) targets a different\n33\tupstream depending on the outcome, so it is decomposed as conditional branches attached\n34\tto