age build, not the start of this work.\n48\t\n49\t## Scope\n50\t\n51\t- Productized container image build for MinIO from the midstream source\n52\t  (pinned upstream version, platform base-image and labeling conventions).\n53\t- Upgrade path for the image across platform releases, including a\n54\t  re-pinnable version strategy for future upstream updates.\n55\t- A published image digest that the Platform Operator integration can pin as\n56\t  a configuration reference.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- A productized MinIO container image is built from the midstream source with\n61\t  the pinned version recorded.\n62\t- The Konflux build pipeline is green for the image build.\n63\t- The image is published with a stable digest available for the operator's\n64\t  wiring (the digest is a configuration reference filled in at execution\n65\t  time; it does not create a dependency on this work).\n66\t- An upgrade path is defined: moving to a newer upstream MinIO version does\n67\t  not require redesigning the productization.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- HLR-2 (P0): productized images and upgrade lifecycle for the bundled store\n72\t  (MinIO chain).\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b0fdef6ac3208a4","agent_id":"a6d71dbe50c997a3d","session_id":"fb56929f-df9e-42c6-b5d2-389b8632f829","uuid":"18528068-8b48-43ba-a553-515a938a81f4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:30:55.930Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-816cb2d33f852504","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9012 decomposition"}
