n47\timage build, not the start of this work.\n48\t\n49\t## Scope\n50\t\n51\t- Productized container image build for the fallback store from the midstream\n52\t  source (pinned upstream version, platform base-image and labeling\n53\t  conventions).\n54\t- Upgrade path for the image across platform releases, including a\n55\t  re-pinnable version strategy for future upstream updates.\n56\t- A published image digest that the Platform Operator integration can pin as\n57\t  a configuration reference.\n58\t\n59\t## Acceptance Criteria\n60\t\n61\t- A productized fallback-store container image is built from the midstream\n62\t  source with the pinned version recorded.\n63\t- The Konflux build pipeline is green for the image build.\n64\t- The image is published with a stable digest available for the operator's\n65\t  wiring (the digest is a configuration reference filled in at execution\n66\t  time; it does not create a dependency on this work).\n67\t- An upgrade path is defined: moving to a newer upstream version does not\n68\t  require redesigning the productization.\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\t- HLR-2 (P0): productized images and upgrade lifecycle for the bundled store\n73\t  (fallback chain).\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b0fdef6ac3208a4","agent_id":"a6d71dbe50c997a3d","session_id":"fb56929f-df9e-42c6-b5d2-389b8632f829","uuid":"ece4b594-09c2-402b-80ed-93025cd84ecc","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:31:02.145Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bee0898cf433c819","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9012 decomposition"}
